# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxcb
pkgver=1.17.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X protocol C binding"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libxau libxdmcp)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libxcb-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('599ebf9996710fea71622e6e184f3a8ad5b43d0e5fa8c4e407123c88a59a6d55')

build() {
    cd libxcb-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static \
        --disable-devel-docs --without-doxygen
    make
}

package() {
    cd libxcb-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
